  "_dash_note": "Line dash pattern, as an ECharts lineStyle.type array; null is solid. Colour alone could not separate three runtimes of one engine: the shades within a family are deliberately close, which is what makes the family readable and the members hard to tell apart. Dash carries the runtime so hue can keep carrying the engine.",
  "_stub_note": "Every entry here is produced by the matrix. Entries were once kept for retired engines so archived runs could still render a name, but no archive references them any more, and a registry that lists series nothing can emit is just a place for stale names to hide. Removing an engine means removing it here too."
